From 268d14a1b0e0a7b0954db72a77cc5b7ffc1a5986 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:46:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(plans): remove Free plan, add Reseller Pro,
 unlimited products & orders
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Seed catalog is now Starter (default), Business, Custom, Reseller and the
  new Reseller Pro (50 admins, "contact" CTA). The Free plan is gone.
- maxProducts = 0 means unlimited. Product creation, downgrade warnings,
  plan-request warnings and the super-admin over-limit badge all honour it.
  Orders never had a limit, so nothing is enforced there; the UIs now state
  "unlimited orders" explicitly.
- New shops fall back to the default plan (isDefault) instead of a hard-coded
  "free"; Shop schema default is now "starter".
- Admin and super-admin plan screens render 0 products as "আনলিমিটেড".
- Add migrations/removeFreePlanAndUnlimited.js (idempotent): moves free shops
  to TARGET_PLAN (default starter), deletes the free plan, zeroes maxProducts
  on every plan and shop, creates reseller-pro and re-orders plans.
