From 6351d839f6c49dd9a1bceba16a70b35a24eb8207 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:46:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(landing): show excluded plan features
 struck-through; replace letter icons

- Public plans API now returns featureList ({key,label,included}), plus
  notIncluded labels. Included features come first, excluded ones last.
  highlights is kept (included only) for older consumers.
- ECMS landing plan cards render included features with a check and excluded
  ones greyed with a cross and strike-through (with sr-only text for screen
  readers), so plans can be compared at a glance.
- Plan badges use lucide icons (Rocket, Briefcase, SlidersHorizontal, Store,
  Building2) instead of the first letter of the plan name; unknown plan keys
  fall back to a rotating icon set.
- Offline fallback plan list updated to match the seed catalog.
